Package: tsc-da200-cups
Version: @VERSION@
Section: text
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Depends: cups, cups-filters, libpappl1, avahi-daemon, systemd
Maintainer: TSC DA200 Open Driver Project
Description: Open CUPS and AirPrint driver for the 203 dpi TSC DA200
 Converts CUPS raster jobs to native TSPL and includes a fixed 4x6 AirPrint
 Printer Application for Raspberry Pi and Debian-based print servers.
